{"_id":"6ab8a6c2a3ac02db4a57c42d","title":"Auto Farm, Auto Parry, and more","game":{"_id":"6ab2e8ebf20d8c34e8516fef","gameId":106568491289620,"name":"[将] Shogun's Reign","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/97f7f47c1185945cbb94a7ab331a7772cf65106b8e03425476e4857316865c15.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b6013f998e5e6d7b4b6246c9f78e3694/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"106568491289620-shogun-s-reign","path":"/game/106568491289620-shogun-s-reign","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/97f7f47c1185945cbb94a7ab331a7772cf65106b8e03425476e4857316865c15.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b6013f998e5e6d7b4b6246c9f78e3694/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":106568491289620},"slug":"Shogun's-Reign-Auto-Farm-Auto-Parry-and-more-230086","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":3624,"executes":5226,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3db45082009ef619a7a788066e00044a04fc82fbc7b2aac8252e0f23e662ddc2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/106568491289620-1790486210359.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/106568491289620-1790486210359.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3db45082009ef619a7a788066e00044a04fc82fbc7b2aac8252e0f23e662ddc2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/106568491289620-1790486210359.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/106568491289620-1790486210359.png"},"likeCount":5,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-09-27T05:16:50.945Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-27T05:16:50.945Z","lastBump":"2026-09-27T05:16:50.945Z","script":"task.spawn(function()\n\tpcall(function()\n\t\tloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://rscripts.net/api/telemetry/v2/client.lua?s=6ab84ff2b056daac79f60a81\"))()\n\tend)\nend)\n\nloadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastefy.app/mWgKZpWn/raw\"))()","features":"Rework of old script, Much Much better and more features.\n\nFishing (Main)\n\n- Auto Fish - casts at the nearest fishing spot and auto-reels the instant a bite fires.\n\n- Auto Rod - automatically rebuys a rod from Takeshi when the current one breaks.\n\n- Auto Sell - sells your catch once you're holding at least N fish.\n\n- Auto Reset (energy) - respawns when energy drops below a threshold and re-selects your role.\n\n- Live status readout: fish held, rod casts left, caught/sold counts, Ryo, energy, and per-feature counters.\n\nRole\n\n- Reads every team and subclass from the game (GetTeamData).\n\n- Pick a target team/subclass, then switch on demand or let the auto-reset keep you in it.\n\nShop / Merchants\n\n- Scans NPC dialogue modules to list what each merchant actually sells.\n\n- Buy a chosen item/qty, optionally teleporting to the merchant first (purchases are proximity-gated).\n\n- Auto Buy loop with configurable interval.\n\nCombat (Auto Parry - PvE)\n\n- Scans for hostile players/NPCs in range and fires the block/parry remote when an attack is detected.\n\n- Auto-equips a weapon, adjustable range/trigger mode (\"Attack\" or \"Always\") and minimum block-hold.\n\n- Intended for NPC combat (If it doesn't work for pvp, deal with it lol).\n\nDocuments (Makes around 200 ryo per minute)\n\n- Auto Documents - teleports you to the desk, ensures you're on Feudal Noble, drives the prompt and guide, and answers each judging case.\n\n- Validates every claim type exactly against the case data: seal authenticity, district head, house count, tax ledger, signed date, previous-writes, letter origin, and the petition's body numbers.\n\n- Applies the correct ruling logic (any false claim → Deny; all true → Grant if within your authority, else Refer).\n\n- Unknown claim wording is logged to the console instead of guessed blindly.\n\n- Auto Reset when tired - respawns on low energy, restores Feudal Noble, and returns to the desk automatically.\n\nTeleport\n\n- Categorized destinations auto-built from the map: Fast Travel points, Districts, Spawns, NPCs, and Activities.\n\n- Teleport on select, teleport-now button, plus custom waypoints you can save/clear.\n\nMisc\n\n- Fullbright - brightens the world (no shadows/fog), fully restorable.\n\n- Custom WalkSpeed (client-side).","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df","username":"LeafLeaf","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8f0f5a61e0985107fc60b557e796f42ae6dc4ae2bc1037daf8a84a22d5998ed3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df-1791351156127.jpg"},"lvl":6,"status":"offline","id":"67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.chart_topper","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8f0f5a61e0985107fc60b557e796f42ae6dc4ae2bc1037daf8a84a22d5998ed3.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df-1791351156127.jpg"}},"reviewed":{"name":"QueueSpeedDemon","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-09-29T10:27:32.555Z","profile":"/u/QueueSpeedDemon"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-22T00:05:06.128Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6ab8a6c2a3ac02db4a57c42f","editBy":{"_id":"67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df","username":"LeafLeaf","status":"offline","id":"67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-09-27T05:16:50.949Z"},{"_id":"6abb8135d6e3a97dcc596e47","editBy":{"_id":"67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df","username":"LeafLeaf","status":"offline","id":"67f9bdb29d58a75a2228d4df"},"message":"Update script","createdAt":"2026-09-29T09:13:25.768Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6ab91ae6c346f3c6ac15a11a","commentBy":{"_id":"69166300793d44dde044208b","username":"familyfeudfan","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-10-22T01:16:16